## Strategic Sequencing

### Wave Structure

**Wave 1: Delivery Exceptions (Months 1-6)**
- **Objective**: Prove agentic value, build foundational platform, establish governance
- **Scope**: DE-3 (Missed Window), DE-4 (Unattended Address), DE-1 (Refused Delivery standard cases)
- **Archetype**: Agent-led + Human Oversight
- **Build Cost**: £80K
- **Annual Saving**: £139.6K
- **Payback**: 6.9 months
- **Platform Assets Built**:
  - CRM REST API integration (reusable)
  - Driver app read-only API integration (reusable)
  - HITL approval workflow (reusable)
  - Agent monitoring + logging infrastructure (reusable)
  - Decision rule engine (reusable)
- **Success Criteria**:
  - Average handling time: 12 min → 6 min for standard cases
  - Human override rate: <15%
  - Customer satisfaction: maintain or improve (NPS ≥ current baseline)
  - Error rate: <2%
  - Payback validation: £139.6K annual saving confirmed by Month 6

**Wave 2: Dispatch Adjustments (Months 7-12)**
- **Objective**: Scale to higher-complexity work stream, leverage Wave 1 platform assets
- **Scope**: DA-1 (Additional Pickup), DA-2 (Route Diversion)
- **Archetype**: Human-led + Agent Support
- **Build Cost**: £135K (includes £50-80K API wrapper)
- **Annual Saving**: £94.8K
- **Payback**: 17.1 months (but **marginal payback 8.5 months** due to Wave 1 platform reuse)
- **Platform Assets Built**:
  - Dispatch console API wrapper (reusable for future dispatch agents)
  - Route optimization logic (reusable)
  - Driver messaging templates (reusable)
- **Prerequisites**:
  - Wave 1 success criteria met
  - Dispatch console API wrapper completed (start in Month 4 of Wave 1)
  - Driver selection criteria formalized
  - Change management with dispatch team + drivers completed
- **Success Criteria**:
  - Average handling time: 18 min → 11 min
  - Human override rate: <20%
  - SLA compliance: maintain or improve (on-time delivery %)
  - Driver satisfaction: maintain or improve (no union grievances)

**Wave 3: Billing Integration (Months 13-18, Optional)**
- **Objective**: Eliminate cross-stream handoff friction, reduce billing dispute resolution time
- **Scope**: Real-time credit workflow outside Aurum with batch reconciliation
- **Archetype**: Human-led + Automation Support
- **Build Cost**: £30-50K
- **Annual Saving**: £10-17K (partial billing delegation)
- **Payback**: 21-36 months (marginal)
- **Decision Gate**: Proceed only if:
  - Wave 1-2 success criteria met
  - Billing dispute volume increases (currently 60/day, 28 min avg)
  - Customer satisfaction metrics justify investment (billing dispute NPS improvement)

